#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""One-shot cross-season evaluation of the frozen R34.0 structure.

This is an isolated pure 1X2 research run with formal_weight=0. It first
reconstructs the 2023/24 R33 goal-event chain from pinned source bytes and
requires exact reproduction of the recorded R34.0 holdout metrics. Only after
that gate passes does it score the independent 2024/25 policy season once,
chronologically, with coefficients frozen and same-date history updates.
"""
